    {
      "round_num": 0,
      "action": "consistency_revision",
      "revised_slots": [
        "main_flow"
      ],
      "inconsistency_hints": [
        "Main flow step 5 only triggers a generic order-generation process. The postconditions require payment-method-specific outcomes that this step does not establish: Credit Card acceptance must also trigger shipment (EC-PO-017), while PayPal/Amazon acceptance must place the order in Hold until payment is received (EC-PO-012). Because the main flow omits these conditional branch outcomes after acceptance, it does not fully lead to the stated postconditions.",
        "Main Flow step 1 introduces an account-data match check that can prevent the offer email from being sent; if matches are found, the Main Flow silently stops and none of the Postconditions can be reached. The Preconditions (and Trigger) do not state that the second-place finisher's account data must not match the original winner's data, so the vertical flow is not continuous for matching-account cases."
      ]
    }
  ],
